  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "Formula 1 World Championship Race Results 1950-2025: Curated and Quality-Assessed Dataset",
  "alternateName": "Cleaned, FAIR-documented derivative of the Ergast/Jolpica-F1 race results",
  "description": "Race results of every FIA Formula One World Championship Grand Prix from 1950-05-13 to 2025-12-07 (76 seasons, 1149 Grands Prix, 25,873 driver entries, 817 drivers, 203 constructor entries, 77 circuits in 34 countries). The dataset is a cleaned, documented derivative of the Ergast database as served by the Jolpica-F1 API. Duplicates, missing keys, sentinel values, inconsistent identifiers and free-text categories were resolved; legitimate historical shared drives were kept and flagged; ISO 3166 country codes and Wikidata identifiers were added.",
